<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
<title>紅布條產生器</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+TC:wght@400;500;700;900&family=Taipei+Sans+TC+Beta:wght@400;700;900&family=LXGW+WenKai+TC:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Sans+HK:wght@400;700;900&family=Klee+One:wght@400;600&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --white: #FFFFFF;
    --paper: #FBFAF8;
    --ink: #4A433D;
    --ink-soft: #857B72;
    --line: #E7E1D9;
    --rose: #C9A79E;
    --rose-deep: #B08D82;
    --sage: #A6AF9C;
    --taupe: #C7BDAE;
    --slate: #97A2A0;
    --shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(74,67,61,0.08);
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html,body{margin:0;padding:0;}
  body{
    background:var(--white);
    color:var(--ink);
    font-family:"Inter","Noto Sans TC",sans-serif;
    min-height:100vh;
  }
  .wrap{
    max-width:1000px;
    margin:0 auto;
    padding:28px 20px 60px;
  }
  header{
    margin-bottom:20px;
  }
  h1{
    font-family:"LXGW WenKai TC","Noto Sans TC",serif;
    font-weight:700;
    font-size:26px;
    margin:0;
    letter-spacing:0.02em;
    color:var(--ink);
  }

  /* ---------- Stage (preview) ---------- */
  .stage-area{
    background:var(--white);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:16px;
    padding:16px;
    box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(74,67,61,0.14);
    margin-bottom:22px;
    position:sticky;
    top:12px;
    z-index:20;
  }
  .stage-frame{
    position:relative;
    width:100%;
    border-radius:10px;
    overflow:hidden;
    background:
      linear-gradient(45deg, #EFEAE2 25%, transparent 25%),
      linear-gradient(-45deg, #EFEAE2 25%, transparent 25%),
      linear-gradient(45deg, transparent 75%, #EFEAE2 75%),
      linear-gradient(-45deg, transparent 75%, #EFEAE2 75%);
    background-size: 24px 24px;
    background-position: 0 0, 0 12px, 12px -12px, -12px 0px;
    background-color:#fff;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
  }
  #stage{
    display:block;
    width:100%;
    height:auto;
  }

  /* ---------- Controls ---------- */
  .panel{
    background:var(--paper);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:16px;
    padding:20px;
    box-shadow:var(--shadow);
  }
  .grid-fields{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap:14px;
    margin-bottom:18px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 620px){
    .grid-fields{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
  }
  .field label{
    font-size:12px;
    font-weight:600;
    color:var(--ink-soft);
    letter-spacing:0.04em;
    display:block;
    margin-bottom:6px;
  }
  input[type="text"]{
    width:100%;
    padding:10px 12px;
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:10px;
    background:var(--white);
    font-family:"Noto Sans TC",sans-serif;
    font-size:14px;
    color:var(--ink);
    outline:none;
    transition:border-color .15s ease;
  }
  input[type="text"]:focus{
    border-color:var(--rose-deep);
  }
  .row{
    display:flex;
    gap:14px;
    align-items:flex-end;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
  }
  .font-field{
    flex:0 0 auto;
  }
  .radio-row{
    display:flex;
    gap:8px;
  }
  .radio-chip{
    text-align:center;
    padding:9px 16px;
    border-radius:10px;
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    background:var(--white);
    font-size:13px;
    cursor:pointer;
    color:var(--ink);
    transition:all .15s ease;
    user-select:none;
  }
  .radio-chip.sans{font-family:"Noto Sans TC",sans-serif; font-weight:700;}
  .radio-chip.active{
    background:var(--rose-deep);
    border-color:var(--rose-deep);
    color:#fff;
  }
  .btn{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    gap:8px;
    padding:11px 22px;
    border-radius:10px;
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    background:var(--rose-deep);
    color:#fff;
    font-size:14px;
    font-weight:600;
    cursor:pointer;
    transition:all .15s ease;
    font-family:"Inter","Noto Sans TC",sans-serif;
    flex:1;
    min-width:160px;
  }
  .btn:hover{background:#9E766B;}
  .icon{width:15px; height:15px; flex:0 0 auto;}

  .style-swatches{
    display:flex;
    gap:12px;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
  }
  .swatch-btn{
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    align-items:center;
    gap:6px;
    background:none;
    border:none;
    cursor:pointer;
    padding:4px;
    font-family:"Noto Sans TC",sans-serif;
  }
  .swatch-circle{
    width:42px;
    height:42px;
    border-radius:50%;
    border:3px solid transparent;
    box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(74,67,61,0.15);
    transition:all .15s ease;
    position:relative;
  }
  .swatch-btn.active .swatch-circle{
    border-color:var(--rose-deep);
    box-shadow:0 0 0 2px #fff, 0 0 0 4px var(--rose-deep);
  }
  .swatch-btn.active .swatch-circle::after{
    content:'✓';
    position:absolute;
    inset:0;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    color:#fff;
    font-size:16px;
    font-weight:700;
    text-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
  }
  .swatch-label{
    font-size:12px;
    color:var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .swatch-btn.active .swatch-label{
    color:var(--ink);
    font-weight:700;
  }

  .footer-note{
    margin-top:22px;
    font-size:11.5px;
    color:var(--ink-soft);
    text-align:center;
    line-height:1.7;
  }

  .template-buttons{
    display:flex;
    gap:10px;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
  }
  .tpl-btn{
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    align-items:center;
    gap:6px;
    padding:10px 12px 9px;
    border-radius:12px;
    border:1.5px solid var(--line);
    background:var(--white);
    cursor:pointer;
    transition:all .15s ease;
    min-width:84px;
  }
  .tpl-btn:hover{border-color:var(--rose);}
  .tpl-btn.active{
    border-color:var(--rose-deep);
    background:#FBF3F0;
  }
  .tpl-icon{
    width:64px;
    height:34px;
    border-radius:4px;
    background:#c81810;
    position:relative;
    overflow:hidden;
    flex:0 0 auto;
  }
  .tpl-icon .bar{
    position:absolute;
    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.92);
    border-radius:1px;
  }
  .tpl-icon.font-icon{
    background:var(--white);
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    color:var(--rose-deep);
    font-size:22px;
    line-height:1;
    border:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .tpl-label{
    font-size:12px;
    color:var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .tpl-btn.active .tpl-label{
    color:var(--ink);
    font-weight:700;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

  <header>
    <h1>紅布條產生器</h1>
  </header>

  <!-- PREVIEW -->
  <div class="stage-area">
    <div class="stage-frame">
      <canvas id="stage"></canvas>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- CONTROLS -->
  <div class="panel">
    <div class="field" style="margin-bottom:18px;">
      <label>布條款式（布邊、繩子）</label>
      <div class="template-buttons" id="constructionButtons"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="field" style="margin-bottom:18px;">
      <label>布條紋路（皺褶質感）</label>
      <div class="template-buttons" id="textureButtons"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="field" style="margin-bottom:18px;">
      <label>布條版型</label>
      <div class="template-buttons" id="templateButtons"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-fields" id="dynamicFields"></div>

    <div class="field" style="margin-bottom:18px;">
      <label>顏色模式</label>
      <div class="radio-row" id="colorModeToggle">
        <div class="radio-chip active" data-mode="solid">純色</div>
        <div class="radio-chip" data-mode="gradient">漸層色</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="field" style="margin-bottom:18px;">
      <label>布條顏色</label>
      <div class="style-swatches" id="styleSwatches"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="field" style="margin-bottom:18px;">
      <label>字型</label>
      <div class="template-buttons" id="fontButtons"></div>
    </div>

    <button class="btn" id="downloadBtn" style="width:100%;">
      <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 3v12M12 15l-4-4M12 15l4-4"/><path d="M4 19h16"/></svg>
      下載圖片
    </button>
  </div>

  <div class="footer-note">
    網站介面色彩取自莫蘭迪色系；字型皆採用 Google Fonts 上的 Noto Sans TC、Taipei Sans TC Beta、LXGW WenKai TC、Noto Sans HK、Klee One（皆為 SIL Open Font License，可商用）。<br>
    所有影像處理皆在您的瀏覽器中完成，不會上傳到伺服器。
  </div>
</div>

